<title>INDIA: India HDFC 97/98 disbursals higher.</title>
<headline>India HDFC 97/98 disbursals higher.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Disbursals by the Housing Development Finance Corporation (HDFC), India's leading housing finance company, rose by 24 percent in the first few months of the current financial year, a company official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>HDFC's disbursals so far in 1997/98 (April-March) were 3.23 billion rupees against 2.61 billion in the same period last year, Deepak Parekh, HDFC chairman said at the company's annual shareholders meeting.</p>
<p>Gross loan approvals rose to 40.71 billion rupees from 30.77 billion, he added.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
